# C071: Schema-backed ChangesetBuilder uses a raw database without its mutex
#
# CONFIRMED — static analysis (data race / async affinity)
#
# sqlite3changegroup_schema retains the raw database (session.c:2167-2231).
# Subsequent additions that encounter a new table consult its schema/defaults
# (session.c:2273-2601).  Neither schema-setup nor the add paths hold the
# connection mutex or route to the AsyncConnection worker, so they race
# connection execution, schema changes, or close.
